  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nBoth overloads of [`isPointInPath`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#dom-context-2d-ispointinpath) are specified to “return the result of the [is point in path steps](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#is-point-in-path-steps) given [this](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this), null, <var>x</var>, <var>y</var>, and <var>fillRule</var>”. I think the second overload should pass <var>path</var> instead of null to the is point in path steps.\r\n",
